{"id":"75ad9c5080756f8f","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-forcing-preservation-theorem-instance.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Preservation Theorem Instance","display":"df-zfc-forcing-preservation-theorem-instance — ZFC Forcing Preservation Theorem Instance","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-preservation-theorem-instance","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-preservation-theorem-instance"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-preservation-theorem-instance — ZFC Forcing Preservation Theorem Instance","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ctm]]","[[58-df-poset]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-forcing-relation]]","[[../batch17/58-df-logic.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-preservation-theorem-instance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-preservation-theorem-instance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-preservation-theorem-instance — ZFC Forcing Preservation Theorem Instance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"58-df-ctm\">58-df-ctm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"58-df-forcing-relation\">58-df-forcing-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-logic.md\">../batch17/58-df-logic.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\Gamma,P,R,\\varphi,1_P\\in V\">\\(M,\\Gamma,P,R,\\varphi,1_P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> is the fully parameterized forcing relation from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"58-df-forcing-relation\">58-df-forcing-relation</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingPreservationTheoremInstance}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingPreservationTheoremInstance}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}preservation\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}instance}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingPreservationTheoremInstance}_S(M,\\Gamma,P,R,\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land P,R\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists1_P\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,1_P\\rangle\\in R)\n\\land\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S(M,1_P,\\varphi,\\varnothing,P,R)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}preservation\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}instance}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingPreservationTheoremInstance}_S(M,\\Gamma,P,R,\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land P,R\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists1_P\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,1_P\\rangle\\in R)\n\\land\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S(M,1_P,\\varphi,\\varnothing,P,R)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A preservation instance is indexed by a set-coded sentence already belonging to the theory satisfied by the CTM, and it records that the greatest condition actually forces that sentence.</li>\n<li>The former implication <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\models\\varphi\\to1_P\\Vdash\\varphi\">\\(M\\models\\varphi\\to1_P\\Vdash\\varphi\\)</span> was false for non-preserved statements and used an under-parameterized forcing notation.  The empty name tuple and both the forcing carrier and order are now explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ctm","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ctm]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-forcing-relation","status":"resolved","id":"46b2495f214783c3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-forcing-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-logic.md","status":"resolved","id":"44e32f3fb4334e0c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-logic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-forcing-relation","status":"resolved","id":"46b2495f214783c3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6$ is the fully parameterized forcing relation from [[58-df-forcing-relation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\Gamma,P,R,\\varphi,1_P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTM}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingPreservationTheoremInstance}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}preservation\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}instance}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingPreservationTheoremInstance}_S(M,\\Gamma,P,R,\\varphi)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land P,R\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\exists1_P\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,1_P\\rangle\\in R)\n\\land\\mathrm{ForcingRelation}_S(M,1_P,\\varphi,\\varnothing,P,R)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"M\\models\\varphi\\to1_P\\Vdash\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1826,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1974","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-forcing-preservation-theorem-instance.md|58-df-zfc-forcing-preservation-theorem-instance]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","66d43bb76d055059","d3f859dbdd37f018","65418b505fc53093","46b2495f214783c3","44e32f3fb4334e0c"]}